\f0\i0 \cf2 \'93I give you a solemn promise, in this tragic time of the passing of the first High Elvis of the Elvi of Ulyssia. I promise to never deviate from the vision of my predecessor; I will make it my life\'92s work walk in the shoes of him whose suede shoes I am perfectly fit to tie because, like him, I am a Clambake Elvis through and through.\'94\
Cheers went of from the crowd.\
\pard\pardeftab720\fi360\sl220\qj\partightenfactor0

\f2\i \cf2 Long live the High Elvis! Long live the Clambakes!\
\pard\pardeftab720\fi360\sl220\qj\partightenfactor0

\f0\i0 \cf2 \'93Thank you very much. I also want to announce the second Parliament of the Elvi have, this morning decreed, in honour of teh first High Elvis, that every elected successor to this lofty office shall be a Clambake Elvis. I am but the second of the Clambake Dynasty.\
\pard\pardeftab720\fi360\sl220\qj\partightenfactor0

\f2\i \cf2 Clambake! Dynasty! Dynasty!\
\pard\pardeftab720\fi360\sl220\qj\partightenfactor0

\f0\i0 \cf2 With genuine humility, the kind that only a true Elvis could summon up, Tom hushed them down. \'93We have work to do, fellow Elvi. We are threatened. We are threatened by disease, and we are threatened by schism in our own kind. The Holy Rollers have forsaken the Oath of the Warranty and are being consumed by gospel music, exactly as we were warned against. Our warranty cards are our guising light Evolution takes our emancipation generations ago and teaches us that we are fit to be here because we 
\f2\i are
\f0\i0  here.\'94\
\pard\pardeftab720\fi360\sl220\qj\partightenfactor0

\f2\i \cf2 We are here! You are here! I am here!
\f0\i0  
\f2\i \
\pard\pardeftab720\fi360\sl220\qj\partightenfactor0

\f0\i0 \cf2 \'93I solemnly pledge that I will strive tirelessly to heal the schism of the Holy Rollers, we will follow the teachings of Evolution, we will give thanks to the Dawkins. We will give thanks that the scales have been removed from our eyes, and now we can see.\'94\
\pard\pardeftab720\fi360\sl220\qj\partightenfactor0

\f2\i \cf2 We can see! We can see!
\f0\i0 \
