\f0\fs22 Chanta ground his teeth. If those Sages wrote one more song, he\'92d have to send them back to Grease or whatever movie set they came from. He was reasonably sure Fisher kept an account for making people disappear; in fact Fisher was curious as to why Chanta hadn\'92t made anyone disappear yet.
\f2\i \
